OL,3,CTrump threatens to bomb Oman if it
OL,4,C'gets in the way' of ending Iran war
OL,6,FDonald Trump threatened to bomb Oman
OL,7,Fif it "gets in the way" of his effort
OL,8,Fto end the US-Israel war on Iran.
OL,10,FFox News says the US President made
OL,11,Fthe comment using an expletive for
OL,12,Femphasis during a phone call on Monday.
OL,14,FIt is the second time Trump has
OL,15,Fdirected such a threat at Muscat, a
OL,16,Flongtime strategic partner that has
OL,17,Ftraditionally served as a key
OL,18,Fbackchannel between Washington and
OL,19,FTehran.
OL,26,@oD@GOUoD@WO]
