PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1787035672
OL,3,CTrump threatens to bomb Oman if it
OL,4,C'gets in the way' of ending Iran war
OL,6,FJournalist Trey Yingst quoted Trump as
OL,7,Fsaying: "If Oman gets in the way,
OL,8,Fwe''ll bomb the s*** out of them."
OL,10,FFox did not provide audio of the
OL,11,Finterview, which was not the example
OL,12,Fof Trump threatening Oman.
OL,14,FIn May, he told reporters during a
OL,15,FCabinet meeting that "Oman will behave
OL,16,Fjust like everybody else, or we will
OL,17,Fhave to blow them up".
OL,26,@oD@IOUpD@bO]wD@VOUyD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
