FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1787035672
OL,3,CTrump threatens to bomb Oman if it
OL,4,C'gets in the way' of ending Iran war
OL,6,FTrump also said the expiration of the
OL,7,F60-day deadline on talks to end the
OL,8,Fwar was irrelevant and said there was
OL,9,Fno timeline, Yingst said.
OL,11,FTrump said the US has a backchannel
OL,12,Ffor talks with Iran's Islamic
OL,13,FRevolutionary Guard Corps, it is
OL,14,Freported, but he was in no hurry to
OL,15,Fbring a conflict to a close.
OL,17,F"They're good poker players, but
OL,18,Fthey're dying," he was quoted as
OL,19,Fsaying.
OL,26,@yD@AOUzD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
