PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1787035672
OL,3,CTrump threatens to bomb Oman if it
OL,4,C'gets in the way' of ending Iran war
OL,6,F"I have no time schedule. I'm not in a
OL,7,Fhurry."
OL,9,FMeanwhile, Iran said it has reached an
OL,10,Fagreement with Oman over a plan for
OL,11,Fships to transit the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,12,Fwhich runs between the countries, and
OL,13,Fthe sides are now working to finalise
OL,14,Fdetails for a joint statement.
OL,16,FIranian Foreign Affairs spokesperson
OL,17,FEsmail Baghaei told reporters in
OL,18,FTehran that "an understanding has been
OL,19,Freached regarding the map of the
OL,20,Ftransit route."
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@GO]zD@MOU|D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
