OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1787035672
OL,3,CTrump threatens to bomb Oman if it
OL,4,C'gets in the way' of ending Iran war
OL,6,FHe did not elaborate, but details that
OL,7,Fhave previously emerged suggest the
OL,8,Fdeal would reopen the waterway with
OL,9,Fships entering through a route close
OL,10,Fto Iran and exiting near Oman. Ships
OL,11,Fwould transit without paying fees or
OL,12,Ftolls during an interim period.
OL,14,FTrump's administration has sought an
OL,15,Facceptable deal on opening the strait
OL,16,Fbefore ending its blockade of Iranian
OL,17,Fports.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
