PN,30706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1787035672
OL,3,CTrump threatens to bomb Oman if it
OL,4,C'gets in the way' of ending Iran war
OL,6,FIran effectively closed the strait `
OL,7,Fthrough which roughly one-fifth of the
OL,8,Fworld's traded oil supplies passed
OL,9,Fbefore the war ` after Israel and the
OL,10,FUS attacked the country on February 28.
OL,12,FBaghaei conceded the talks with Oman
OL,13,Fhave gone slowly, "but we had planned,
OL,14,Fand still plan, to finalise the
OL,15,Funderstanding in the form of a
OL,16,Fpackage: the map plus a joint
OL,17,Fstatement".
OL,26,@uD@SOUyD@JO]
